!About Lojban
* [http://www.lojban.org/whatis.html|What Is Lojban?]
 A brief explanation of the elegant constructed language Lojban.
* [http://www.lojban.org/why_learn.html|Why Learn Lojban?]
 A brief discussion of the reasons that various people find Lojban interesting and worth learning.
* [http://www.lojban.org/where.html|Where Is Lojban Spoken?]
 A list of some of the places where Lojban gets spoken, such as classes and the yearly LogFest.
*  For a much more detailed description of Lojban, you can read or download [http://www.lojban.org/publications/level0.html|What Is Lojban?,] also known as the Level Zero book, edited by Nick Nicholas and John Woldemar Cowan.  This book makes an excellent introduction to Lojban.
    
Please [http://www.lojban.org/llg/feedback.php|contact us] with any comments, suggestions or concerns.